    "created_at": "2016-10-10T16:39:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-10T16:39:34Z",
    "body": "I'm thinking about removing `navigator.bluetooth` on platforms like Windows 7 or MacOX 10.9, where even if the user plugged in a cheap dongle, we still wouldn't be able to give them Web Bluetooth. On platforms that support Bluetooth but machines where they'd have to plug in a dongle, the site would need to use `getAvailability()`.\n",
